  "featured_image": "http://www.flowersinagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/04/fortress2.jpg",
  "body_html": "<p><a href=\"http://www.flowersinagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/04/fortress2.jpg\"><img alt=\"fortress2\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-4533\" height=\"315\" src=\"http://www.flowersinagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/04/fortress2.jpg\" width=\"851\"/></a></p>\n<p>Seriously, this interview with Danish metalheads Förtress came out great! May be you’ve heard of the band from<a href=\"http://noisey.vice.com/en_dk/vice-wimp-live-sessions/vice-x-wimp-live-sessions-frtress\"> Vice’s Noisey</a>, who also featured them, but we find about this kickass band through the page of <a href=\"http://helgasons.com/\">snowboarder Halldór Helgason</a>. Förtress’ music is energetic and feisty with a hilarious comedy zest. It’s just so great to see musicians that are having honest fun on the stage (and behind it), instead of taking themselves too seriously. Should I summarize it in few words? Modern twist on the groovy metal at it’s finest.</p>\n<p><iframe allowfullscreen=\"\" frameborder=\"0\" height=\"248\" src=\"//www.youtube.com/embed/dfflUHlUq5c\" width=\"440\"></iframe></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" class=\"alignnone\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://scontent-a-lga.xx.fbcdn.net/hphotos-frc1/t1.0-9/1797517_576067065822665_960297423_n.jpg\" width=\"851\"/></p>\n<p>PS: You can still catch few shows of their Denmark tour and the exciting news are they’re playing <a href=\"http://roskilde-festival.dk/\">Roskilde Festival.</a></p>\n<p>Find more about Fortress on<a href=\"http://www.flowersinagun.com/video-interview-with-danish-band-fortress-for-flowers-in-a-gun/www.facebook.com/fortressdk\"> Facebook</a>, <a href=\"https://twitter.com/fortressdk\">Twitter </a>and <a href=\"http://instagram.com/fortressdk\">Instagram</a> @FortressDK.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://www.flowersinagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/04/fortress.jpg\"><img alt=\"fortress\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-4534\" height=\"1361\" src=\"http://www.flowersinagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/04/fortress.jpg\" width=\"2048\"/></a></p>",
